{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yVCkACVEJU1792682197.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>薔琵迫近台灣，香港快運(HK Express)宣布，取消明天六班往返香港和台北的航班，往返香港和台中亦有兩班機取消，兩班則延期至周六出發。</p><p></p><p>2026年10月23日</p><p>香港 ←→ 台北</p><p>取消：UO 112、UO 113、UO 114、UO 115、UO 116、UO 117</p><p></p><p>香港 ←→ 台中</p><p>取消：UO 172、UO 173</p><p>延期至2026年10月24日：</p><p>UO 182 → UO 182D （09:55）</p><p>UO 183 → UO 183D（12:20）</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_SSS.FLIGHT.UO 1330 up1900_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026U8IWXNOxYz1792682350.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>而往返香港至高雄，亦有兩班機取消，兩班延期至周六，受影響旅客可免費改期，或申請全額退款。</p><p></p><p>香港 ←→ 高雄</p><p>取消：UO 134、UO 135</p><p>延期至2026年10月24日：</p><p>UO 136 → UO 136D（09:45）</p><p>UO 133 → UO 133D（12:00）</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_SSS.FLIGHT.UO 1330 up1900_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026pCgPi7m1SZ1792682386.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p></p><p>另外，中華航空周五有八班來回香港至台北的客機取消。華航周五亦有兩班，來往香港至高雄的客機取消。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_SSS.FLIGHT.UO 1330 up1900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iutdYsJcMC1792682325.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:24.272891+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":409,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:00.296264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:00.296264+00:00","content_hash":"c28ff42e5f363b2db1951100e4bf661bb8fe043d8f3a34c924ab9ad71b32d217","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}